    "productDescriptionProps": {
      "paragraphs": [
        "Comfortable sofa-bed with a clean-lined design that is just as comfortable to sit on as it is to sleep in ─ from time to time or every night.",
        "This sofa converts quickly and easily into a roomy bed when you lift out the underframe and fold down the backrest.",
        "Easily converts into a full size bed for two.",
        "The large storage space under the seat has plenty of room for things like bedding.",
        "Medium-firm comfort in both the seat and back cushions.",
        "The back cushions provide excellent support for the back and lumbar region, while your shoulders enjoy comfortable relief.",
        "10-year limited warranty. Read about the terms in the limited warranty brochure."
      ],
